# NOTE: models/sscd_disc_mixup.onnx (98MB) IS committed on purpose — it's bundled into
# the packaged app (kempo-app builds with asar:false, so extra folders ship as-is) and
# there's no public ONNX build of SSCD to download instead. It sits ~1.8MB under GitHub's
# 100MB per-file hard limit; if the model is ever swapped for a larger one, move it to
# git-lfs rather than trying to squeeze under the cap.
# Intermediate conversion artifacts are not committed:
models/*.torchscript.pt
models/*.int8.onnx
